    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spătŭla</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spăth-</span></b> ),
		ae, f.
		dim.
		spatha. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A broad piece</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porcina,</span>”
				<i>a leg of pork</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Apic. 4, 3, § 174</span></i>
			 sqq.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A little palmbranch</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Lev.
				23, 40</span></i>.</div>
